<section class="container page-intro narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</p><h1>Your enquiry information.</h1><p class="lead">We use the details you submit to review and respond to your business enquiry.</p></section><section class="container prose section-topless"><h2>What the form collects</h2><p>Your name, company, business email, country, buyer type, selected instruments, quantities and any requirements you enter are stored with your enquiry reference. Distribution enquiries may also include territories, instrument interests and purchasing plans. Please do not include patient information or sensitive personal data.</p><h2>How it is handled</h2><p>Enquiries are stored on the website’s server for review by the business. Where email notifications are configured, the enquiry is also sent to the business mailbox through its email provider. Administrators can record sales status and notes. The information is not used by this website for advertising.</p><h2>Optional buyer account</h2><p>If you register, we store your name, email and a password hash. A secure session cookie keeps you signed in for up to seven days. Only new enquiries submitted while signed in are attached to your account; knowing an email address does not grant access to earlier enquiries. You can sign out or change your password from your account.</p><h2>Optional email updates</h2><p>The separate updates form records your email, explicit preference, consent time and a private withdrawal link. It does not automatically send email or subscribe quotation buyers. Keep your private link to withdraw the preference, or contact our team. Mailing activation and address verification are managed separately by the business.</p><h2>Browser storage and security</h2><p>Your quote list stays in this browser using local storage until you remove items or clear browser data. The enquiry form uses a security cookie, valid for up to 24 hours. Account and subscription forms use additional security cookies. Hashed network addresses are temporarily used to limit abusive submissions. This site does not include advertising or analytics trackers.</p><h2>Access and deletion</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:<%= business.email %>"><%= business.email %></a> with your enquiry reference to ask about your information or request deletion. Enquiry and account records remain in business storage until removed. Contact us to discuss access, correction or deletion of your information.</p></section>
